# Product-smoke gate budget (#1509).
#
# The wall clock the driver gives `.pi/smoke-cmd` (this repo has none, so the
# gate notes the omission and never runs). Kept separate from the suite tier on
# purpose: one product path is a seconds-scale check, and it must not widen
# just because the offline suite needs half an hour. First non-empty,
# non-comment line, a positive number of milliseconds.
#
# Precedence: PI_ENSEMBLE_VERIFY_SMOKE_TIMEOUT_MS →
# PI_ENSEMBLE_VERIFY_TIMEOUT_MS → this file → the documented default (10 min).
600000
